# What an orchestra task with no identity of its own may do: the GitHub grant, as it was.
#
# The grant reads the task's facts — its fork, its upstream, its tools — from the token's
# authority block, which is where /.kleis/v1/derive puts them for a task made from a spec.
spec worker
  description "An orchestra task working on a repository."
  max_ttl 24h

  grant orchestra-github
